#' Field description: dropoutObservationTime 1
#' @field dropoutObservationTime1 Mean finishing analysis time in arm 1 over exactly the replications contributing to the corresponding observed dropout proportion, in the same time units as accrual and survival. NA if no replication contributes. Available only for patient-wise simulation. Numeric vector over scenarios for two-arm trials; in multi-arm trials, arm 1 is a matrix of active-arm rows and scenario columns (a vector for one active arm), and arm 2 is a vector over scenarios for shared control. In enrichment trials, both arms have population rows (subpopulations followed by the full population) and scenario columns, or a vector for one population. Discontinued arms and populations are retained; overlapping populations include their shared subjects. There is no stage dimension. NULL for test-statistic-based simulation.
#' @keywords internal
